---
const features = [
	{ title: "Website builder", desc: "— public site with venue hire & bistro bookings baked in" },
	{ title: "Venue hire wizard", desc: "— package pricing, deposits, contracts" },
	{ title: "Bistro bookings", desc: "— floor plans, sittings, SMS reminders" },
	{ title: "Membership CRM", desc: "— join forms, renewals, tiers, concessions" },
	{ title: "Email & SMS comms", desc: "— unlimited sends, segmented" },
	{ title: "Payments & Xero sync", desc: "— one ledger, reconciled nightly" },
	{ title: "Unlimited admins", desc: "& Wellington-hours support" },
];
---

<article class="pricing__plan">
	<span class="pricing__plan-glow" aria-hidden="true"></span>

	<div class="pricing__plan-side">
		<span class="pricing__plan-eyebrow">
			<span class="pricing__plan-eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			One plan · everything in
		</span>

		<div class="pricing__plan-price">
			<span class="pricing__plan-price-value">$80</span>
			<span class="pricing__plan-price-meta">
				/ month
				<span class="pricing__plan-price-meta-sub">NZD · billed monthly</span>
			</span>
		</div>

		<div class="pricing__plan-fees">
			<span class="pricing__plan-fees-head">
				<span class="pricing__plan-fees-head-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				Then, when you start earning
			</span>
			<div class="pricing__plan-fees-grid">
				<div class="pricing__plan-fee">
					<span class="pricing__plan-fee-value">+ 5%</span>
					<span class="pricing__plan-fee-note">
						of bookings · <span class="pricing__plan-fee-note-strong">venue hire &amp; bistro</span>
					</span>
				</div>
				<span class="pricing__plan-fees-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				<div class="pricing__plan-fee">
					<span class="pricing__plan-fee-value">+ $1</span>
					<span class="pricing__plan-fee-note">
						per event entry · <span class="pricing__plan-fee-note-strong">tournaments &amp; comps</span>
					</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<p class="pricing__plan-fees-foot">
				Nothing on member subs or free RSVPs. If no money moves through Torny, the only bill is the $80.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="pricing__plan-actions">
			<a href="https://app.torny.club/" class="btn btn--primary">Start free trial</a>
			<a href="/demo" class="btn btn--ghost-light">Book a demo →</a>
		</div>
	</div>

	<span class="pricing__plan-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>

	<div class="pricing__plan-features">
		<div class="pricing__plan-features-head">Every module. No upgrades.</div>
		{
			features.map((f) => (
				<div class="pricing__plan-feature">
					<span class="pricing__plan-feature-tick" aria-hidden="true">
						✓
					</span>
					<span>
						<b>{f.title}</b> {f.desc}
					</span>
				</div>
			))
		}
		<p class="pricing__plan-context">
			<b>For context:</b> a one-off club website build is $8-15k and still needs a plugin for bookings. $80/month is less
			than that bill's monthly interest.
		</p>
	</div>
</article>
